        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Kickstarter Comments\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n Kickstarter Comments:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p><span>Wednesday's update this week will have some awesome things for all of you fine folks to download. Friday's update will contain OblivAeon gameplay.</span></p>\n<p><span>I'll post Friday's update in the morning so I can answer questions about it during the Twitch stream at noon <span>.</span></span></p>\n<p><span>-Christopher</span></p>\n<span>\n</span></blockquote>\n</aside>",
